WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:00.360
All right.

00:00.360 --> 00:04.800
So now I would like to share something important with you, especially as future developer that is working

00:04.800 --> 00:05.480
with AI.

00:05.640 --> 00:12.360
One of the best ways, in order to truly build skill and to grow as a developer is by working on complex

00:12.360 --> 00:14.760
tasks and issues on your own.

00:14.800 --> 00:20.120
So when you are stuck on complex task and you are pushing yourself to find a solution for it, and you

00:20.160 --> 00:25.680
are writing your code and yourself here, the magic happens and the real learning can happen.

00:25.680 --> 00:31.840
And if you jump too quickly and ask the AI for a solution what you are doing, you are skipping an essential

00:31.840 --> 00:34.080
step in order to become an expert.

00:34.120 --> 00:40.080
And more important than that, you won't develop skills in order to understand when and where the AI

00:40.120 --> 00:40.840
was wrong.

00:40.960 --> 00:43.520
So my recommendation here is to have a discipline.

00:43.560 --> 00:47.360
Always try to solve the task on your own, and only turn to your AI.

00:47.400 --> 00:50.480
If you don't have any more ideas on how to solve the task.

00:50.600 --> 00:53.040
So that's my opinion and my advice for you.
